msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Imej hero\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to *Use a quantum computer today*! In the course, you'll start using"
" a quantum computer immediately, and learn the basic principles of quantum "
"computing along the way.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang ke *Guna komputer kuantum hari ini*! Dalam kursus ini, kamu "
"terus mula menggunakan komputer kuantum, sambil belajar prinsip-prinsip asas"
" pengkomputeran kuantum dalam perjalanan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is designed for the curious and the busy. You don't need a "
"physics degree or years of programming experience. If you can follow along "
"with a notebook and click \"Run,\" you're ready.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini direka untuk orang yang ingin tahu dan orang yang sibuk. Kamu tak"
" perlu ijazah fizik atau bertahun-tahun pengalaman pengaturcaraan. Jika kamu"
" boleh ikuti notebook dan klik \"Run,\" kamu dah bersedia.\n"
